sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant BATCH as SVC-001 Batch Scheduler
    participant CAP001 as CAP-001 API (SVC-001)
    participant EventBus as Event Bus (SVC-102)
    participant CAP004 as CAP-004 (SVC-012)
    participant EXTBUREAU as EXT: Credit Bureau
    participant SVC053 as SVC-053 (Notifications)
    participant PER001 as PER-001 (Personal Customer)

    Note over BATCH,CAP001: PH-083: Automated Review Trigger
    BATCH->>CAP001: Identify account with overdraft expiring
    CAP001--)EventBus: publish OverdraftReviewTriggered EVT-114

    Note over CAP004,EXTBUREAU: PH-084: Credit Bureau Refresh — Adverse Data
    EventBus--)CAP004: EVT-114 consumed
    CAP004->>EXTBUREAU: Credit bureau refresh
    EXTBUREAU-->>CAP004: Bureau score=280, CCJ registered, IVA in progress
    CAP004--)EventBus: publish OverdraftAssessmentCompleted EVT-115 (grade=F, adverse=[CCJ,IVA])

    Note over CAP001: PH-085: Persistent Debt Screening
    EventBus--)CAP001: EVT-115 consumed
    CAP001->>CAP001: Persistent debt screening (secondary — withdrawal driven by credit grade)
    CAP001--)EventBus: publish PersistentDebtScreeningCompleted EVT-116

    Note over CAP001: PH-086: Decision — Facility Withdrawal (30-day notice)
    CAP001->>CAP001: Decision: withdraw. withdrawal_effective_date = decided_at + 30 days
    CAP001--)EventBus: publish OverdraftReviewDecided EVT-117 (decision=withdraw)

    Note over SVC053,PER001: PH-087: Withdrawal Notice + Debt Advice
    CAP001--)SVC053: Dispatch withdrawal notice (registered post + email + in-app)
    SVC053--)PER001: Letter: overdraft withdrawn in 30 days. StepChange, Citizens Advice
    CAP001--)EventBus: publish OverdraftCustomerNotified EVT-118
